        images: undefined,
        rawContent: "'''Liberation Day''' marked the final defeat of the [[Anderung]] at the hands of the [[United Mesarthrim Clans]] at the end of the [[Siege of Stone Bridge]].\r\n\r\n[[Category:History]]"
